  <metadata>
    <name>Wansfell Round</name>
    <desc>11.6 km with 480 m of climb. From the Bracken Fell Harriers route book.</desc>
  </metadata>
  <trk>
    <name>Wansfell Round</name>
    <desc>Up the stone steps out of town and onto Wansfell Pike the direct way — half an hour of proper climbing, no apologies — then over the top and down through Troutbeck's lanes and Skelghyll Woods. The summit view down the length of Windermere is the photo every club member has.</desc>
